meta {
  name: Customer Auth
  seq: 3
}

docs {
  Storefront customer identity — completely separate from admin `users`
  (there is no login endpoint here for admins; that's a Fase 2/backoffice
  concern). Register and Login both return a Sanctum bearer token and
  auto-save it into the {{customer_token}} environment variable via a
  post-response script, so "Orders" requests work immediately after.
}
